 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Strategies for analytical reading in texts on art",
     "texto": [
      "At B2.2 level, a critical text does not limit itself to recounting biographical anecdotes, but articulates a rigorous argument:",
      "1. **Identify the aesthetic thesis (Hauptthese)**: it is usually formulated at the beginning or end of the passage through complex subordinate clauses.",
      "2. **Separate material evidence from analytical inference**: dimensions, support and pigments are empirical data; spiritual symbolism is an interpretive proposal.",
      "3. **Trace connectors of qualification (allerdings, indessen, vielmehr)**: they reveal decisive argumentative turns where the author refutes traditional readings."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
